00:00:01,940 --> 00:00:29,380
Amid our current political moment, it is more crucial than ever that we protect and support spaces that bring everyday people together and provide them with the context and the resources that will allow them to nurture a radical political analysis and build collective political formations that are independent, not only of the mainstream political duopoly, but also of the university system, which is increasingly hostile to critical thought.

2
00:00:29,380 --> 00:00:35,540
This is the work that the W.E.B. Du Bois Movement School is doing, and this is why we need to support them.

